  "title": "Disabling a Network Decoy",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://help.zscaler.com/deception/disabling-network-decoy",
    "node": "1542266",
    "revision": "3221872",
    "updated": "2026-09-22",
    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-03",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "You can stop all decoys at once via the Summary page (Deceive > Summary). If you want to stop a single decoy, you can disable it."
    },
    {
      "text": "To disable a network decoy:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Stop the decoys.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Deceive > Network Decoys.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          30
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the Internal or Zero Trust Network tab.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          11,
          19
        ],
        [
          23,
          41
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Navigate to the network decoy you want to disable, and under Actions, click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          61,
          68
        ],
        [
          80,
          84
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Network Decoy Detail window, select the General tab.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          27
        ],
        [
          47,
          54
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Deselect Enabled, and then click Submit.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          9,
          17
        ],
        [
          33,
          39
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "text": "The network decoy is disabled and the decoy status icon turns gray ()."
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "item": "Start the decoys.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot deploy a disabled decoy. You must enable it again to deploy it."
    }
  ]
}
